# Evaluator-owned receipts are committed; harness state, workspaces, raw harness logs and per-trial tokens are not.
# Kept per trial: logs/adapter.log. The installed-HEAD check and start_hook lines of each gstack-register.log are in register-checks.jsonl.
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
!run.log
!proxy.log
!preflight-*.log
!trials/*/logs/adapter.log
